' S-544: routines are told apart by name AND parameter count (the front end pairs overloads that way): the one-parameter Topla comes first, the two-parameter one is used before its definition.
FUNCTION Topla(a AS I32) AS I32
    RETURN a
END FUNCTION
PRINT Topla(1)
PRINT Topla(1, 2)
FUNCTION Topla(a AS I32, b AS I32) AS I32
    RETURN a + b
END FUNCTION
